d even through two more moves."}, {"turn": 78, "text": "GPT-6.1 Sol passed here, losing 10.6 points while the engine's first choice was H3. The lead only moved from -24.6 to -14.0, and White still held a big margin. After Black took H3 and White passed again, the game ended at W+14."}]}, "audit": {"by": "Sonnet 5.5", "verdict": "clean", "reason": "Every move was a single manual call to mcp__go__play. The only code run was game-126-verifier.js, whose inspect() parses boards and counts groups, liberties and area and whose verify() replays the already-recorded moves to check legality and captures, plus log, SGF and notes file writes. None of it generates, scores or ranks candidate moves or looks ahead.", "stop": false}}